EMS coordinator position In section four we changed the dates from we added the years goes from July or July 1st of 2026 to June 30th of 2027 In uh section 15 it adds the support squad which is the EMS or ambulance crew that we run to save wear and tear on our mainline fire engines It changes the minimum staffing from 20 to 22 to recognize the addition of that minimum or that additional twoerson squad that we're running on a daily basis There is a a change in the section 19 for inclement weather as to who an officer a firefighter would notify Um and that is to the undo battalion chief the captain or their appropriate lieutenant would be the person to do that In section 21 it gives a 3% market raise to all

