specialty pays Um and then the contract also has the charts that show all of those new pay raises Section 26 to help with overtime Uh it it kind of changed the way that uh members can schedule their overtime in EOD We now have four slots available for those overtime and it limits the cancellations um a period of time with cancellations so they can't be at the last minute giving battalion chiefs the opportunity to know who their their staff will be And then it limits the uh scheduling of EOD and vacation shifts to two above the minimum for staffing So our minimum staffing is 22 So they would be able to um our firefighters uh when they bid their vacation times could could take those times down to our minimum staffing of 24 at that point It gives the battalion chief the deputy chiefs and

