sick time We're trying to do those those u percentages and it's just too hard for uh our staff to do those in a timely manner Um they uh also requires that scheduled vacations be used every year and uh they can only be banked if there was a reason for that like an injury or a lung illness or they were denied the ability to take vacation because we just needed their help and we we couldn't take their vacation Basically if it was no fault of their own um that's the only reason that they can bank vacation Day personnel can now use sick leave as our normal employees do to uh get to medical appointments um those types of things Um

